This product's desktop app can download and run the PP-OCRv6 small models
(detection and recognition) from PaddleOCR, developed by the PaddlePaddle
Authors (https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The models are not bundled; the character
dictionary used with the recognition model is bundled unmodified.
